.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-config-info 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-config\-info \- Show the current device configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-config\-info\fR [\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the current device configuration.
.PP
Firmware before 3.1 requires the Admin PIN to read configuration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<PIN>\fR
CanoKey Admin PIN (required for configuration reads before 3.1)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
